              "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"6373d59e-25da-49c7-b889-fb12dc36acd7\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/6373d59e-25da-49c7-b889-fb12dc36acd7\"/>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var> угол <var data-math-identifier=\"ACB\">ACB</var> равен <span data-inline-latex=\"90\"></span>°, угол <var data-math-identifier=\"B\">B</var> равен <span data-inline-latex=\"58\"></span>°, <var data-math-identifier=\"CD\">CD</var>  — ме­ди­а­на. Най­ди­те угол <var data-math-identifier=\"ACD\">ACD</var>. Ответ дайте в гра­ду­сах.</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": [
                "image_1"
